allow yourself to be vulnerable on the page&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:31.560
and list your fears in writing the story you are&nbsp;
you're connecting to the truth of your story and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:37.320
you're discovering how you are uniquely qualified&nbsp;
to write this story because you're writing for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:43.280
this raw vulnerable place I think sometimes we&nbsp;
have this idea of what it means to be a good&nbsp;&nbsp;

